{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsheading"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/init(_:tableName:bundle:coloredText:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/init(_:tableName:bundle:size:hasMarker:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/init(text:coloredText:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/init(text:size:hasMarker:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/body"],"generated":true},{"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/Size"],"generated":true},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHeading","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSHeading","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Foundations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Sizes","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Sizes"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"XLarge","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest heading, useful for page titles.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Large (by default)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default heading. Only this size supports the marker and the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"colored substring","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" feature.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Medium","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A medium heading, typically used for section titles.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Small","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The smallest heading, used for subsection titles.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Marker","anchor":"Marker","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some themes (like ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Wireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") declare that a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"large","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" heading is decorated with a small","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"coloured rectangle below the text, i.e. the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Other themes (like ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") do not use a marker at all but something else.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Coloring a substring","anchor":"Coloring-a-substring","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A dedicated initializer accepts a ","type":"text"},{"code":"coloredText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sub-string instead of a marker.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is useful to emphasize a specific word inside a heading (for example a brand name). This feature is only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"meaningful for ","type":"text"},{"code":"size == .large","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on other sizes a warning is logged and the text is rendered plain.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","style":"warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all themes provide a valid "},{"code":"theme.colors.contentBrandSecondary","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the token is marked as forbidden). When the token is forbidden the coloring is skipped."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Simple raw string","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Title\")","","    \/\/ Large heading with a marker (rendered only when the theme supports it)","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Section title\", size: .large, hasMarker: true)","","    \/\/ Smaller heading (marker parameter would be ignored here)","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Sub-section\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Heading with a brand-coloured word","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Welcome to Orange\", coloredText: \"Orange\")","","    \/\/ Combined: coloured word","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Welcome to Sosh\", coloredText: \"Sosh\")","","    \/\/ Localizable from a bundle","    OUDSHeading(LocalizedStringKey(\"section_title\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .large)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"